COMPILATION OF: E49A4

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49A4

   1 a 0000 E49A4:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P1] the inverted compare with an OVER-EXTENT literal,
   4 a 0006      'ABCD' against char(3).  No object anywhere compares a fixed
   5 a 0006      member with a longer literal: str_cmp_shape_fix's own comment
   6 a 0006      records DR's verdict as [TBD] (not gated, matching the varying
   7 a 0006      family's ungated MVI len arms), and [C191]'s truncation
   8 a 0006      witness (E30T1, len 8 / cap 6) is a STORE.  This is a VERDICT
   9 a 0006      question first: accept gives 06 04 / 3E 03 in the form this
  10 a 0006      round selects; refuse makes it dr-refuses law. */
  11 c 0006   dcl
  12 c 0006     1 rec,
  13 c 0006       2 name char(3),
  14 c 0006       2 nxt fixed bin(15);
  15 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  16 c 0006   if rec.name = 'ABCD' then k = 1;
  17 c 001D   put list('K=', k);
  18 c 003F   stop;
  19 a 0042 end E49A4;

CODE SIZE = 0042
DATA AREA = 000D
FREE SYMS = 3875
END  COMPILATION
